          <msContents>
            <summary>Collection of medical receipts, remedies and 'secrets' in Italian and Latin. Written in a neat upright hand, and in a Venetian dialect. The name of the compiler appears to be given on p. 426, line 15: 'Recepta vera et probata per mi dom Zouane monacho in sancta Iustina ...': there is a similar statement on p. 439, line 8. Produced in Venice?</summary>
